      "content": "that feels like such a scripted answer lol. i don't need a hobby or to \"engage in activities.\" it’s not that i’m bored, it’s that the version of me that people actually knew is just... gone. it’s like you can delete a person from a group chat and they’re just a ghost in the machine. i feel like i’m just haunting my own life at this point. how am i supposed to \"rebuild\" when the person i was doesn't even exist to them anymore?",
